{"seq":4,"slug":"streaming-and-suspense","title":"流式渲染与 Suspense","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/streaming-and-suspense","wordCount":751,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"流式渲染与-suspense\">流式渲染与 Suspense</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>传统 SSR 是「全有或全无」的：必须渲染完整个页面才能发送响应，也必须处理完整棵树才能开始水合，遇到慢数据源就会拖垮整页。流式渲染让 Shell 一就绪就发送响应，配合 Suspense 把慢内容作为后续 chunk 补发。本章讲解传统 SSR 的瓶颈、Suspense 作为流式边界的作用、流式 HTML 的传输方式、渐进式加载与优先级控制，以及流式场景下的 SEO 与错误处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传统-ssr-的瓶颈\">传统 SSR 的瓶颈</h2><p>传统 SSR 是&quot;全有或全无&quot;的——服务器必须渲染完整个页面的 HTML 才能发送响应，水合也必须处理完整个组件树才能开始交互。这在页面包含慢速数据源时会导致严重的性能问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 传统 SSR&#10;        A[等待所有数据] --&gt; B[渲染所有 HTML]&#10;        B --&gt; C[发送完整 HTML]&#10;        C --&gt; D[下载所有 JS]&#10;        D --&gt; E[水合整个页面]&#10;        E --&gt; F[可交互]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 流式 SSR&#10;        G[Shell 就绪] --&gt; H[立即发送 Shell]&#10;        H --&gt; I[浏览器开始渲染]&#10;        G --&gt; J[继续获取数据]&#10;        J --&gt; K[流式发送延迟内容]&#10;        K --&gt; L[逐步水合]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 传统 SSR\n        A[等待所有数据] --&gt; B[渲染所有 HTML]\n        B --&gt; C[发送完整 HTML]\n        C --&gt; D[下载所有 JS]\n        D --&gt; E[水合整个页面]\n        E --&gt; F[可交互]\n    end\n    subgraph 流式 SSR\n        G[Shell 就绪] --&gt; H[立即发送 Shell]\n        H --&gt; I[浏览器开始渲染]\n        G --&gt; J[继续获取数据]\n        J --&gt; K[流式发送延迟内容]\n        K --&gt; L[逐步水合]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>传统 SSR</th>\n<th>流式 SSR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首字节时间</td>\n<td>等所有数据</td>\n<td>Shell 就绪即发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次内容绘制</td>\n<td>完整 HTML 到达后</td>\n<td>Shell 到达后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可交互时间</td>\n<td>完整水合后</td>\n<td>选择性水合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户感知</td>\n<td>长时间空白/加载</td>\n<td>渐进式内容出现</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"suspense-boundaries\">Suspense Boundaries</h2><p><code>Suspense</code> 组件在流式 SSR 中定义了<strong>加载边界</strong>。服务端首先发送 Suspense 的 fallback HTML，当实际内容准备好后通过内联 <code>&lt;script&gt;</code> 替换 fallback。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;HeroSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;HeroBanner /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ProductsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;ProductList /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ReviewsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Reviews /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Footer /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;HeroSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;HeroBanner /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ProductsSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;ProductList /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ReviewsSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Reviews /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Footer /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务端发送的 HTML 顺序：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant S as 服务器&#10;    participant B as 浏览器&#10;&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: [1] Shell HTML + Header + Footer + 三个 Skeleton&#10;    Note over B: 立即开始渲染骨架&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: [2] HeroBanner HTML + 替换脚本&#10;    Note over B: 替换 HeroSkeleton&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: [3] ProductList HTML + 替换脚本&#10;    Note over B: 替换 ProductsSkeleton&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: [4] Reviews HTML + 替换脚本&#10;    Note over B: 替换 ReviewsSkeleton&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;B: [5] 流结束\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant S as 服务器\n    participant B as 浏览器\n\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: [1] Shell HTML + Header + Footer + 三个 Skeleton\n    Note over B: 立即开始渲染骨架\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: [2] HeroBanner HTML + 替换脚本\n    Note over B: 替换 HeroSkeleton\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: [3] ProductList HTML + 替换脚本\n    Note over B: 替换 ProductsSkeleton\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: [4] Reviews HTML + 替换脚本\n    Note over B: 替换 ReviewsSkeleton\n    S-&gt;&gt;B: [5] 流结束</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"streaming-html\">Streaming HTML</h2><p>React 的流式 SSR 使用浏览器原生的 HTML 流式解析能力。服务端通过 chunked transfer encoding 逐段发送 HTML：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { renderToPipeableStream } from &#39;react-dom/server&#39;;&#10;&#10;app.get(&#39;*&#39;, (req, res) =&gt; {&#10;  const { pipe } = renderToPipeableStream(&lt;App /&gt;, {&#10;    bootstrapScripts: [&#39;/main.js&#39;],&#10;    onShellReady() {&#10;      res.setHeader(&#39;Content-Type&#39;, &#39;text/html; charset=utf-8&#39;);&#10;      res.setHeader(&#39;Transfer-Encoding&#39;, &#39;chunked&#39;);&#10;      pipe(res);&#10;    },&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { renderToPipeableStream } from 'react-dom/server';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>app.get('*', (req, res) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const { pipe } = renderToPipeableStream(&#x3C;App />, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    bootstrapScripts: ['/main.js'],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    onShellReady() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.setHeader('Content-Type', 'text/html; charset=utf-8');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      res.setHeader('Transfer-Encoding', 'chunked');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      pipe(res);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务端发送的 HTML 结构（简化）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;!-- 第一块：Shell --&gt;&#10;&lt;div id=&quot;root&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;header&gt;网站标题&lt;/header&gt;&#10;  &lt;div&gt;&#10;    &lt;!--$?--&gt;&lt;template id=&quot;B:0&quot;&gt;&lt;/template&gt;&#10;    &lt;div&gt;加载中...&lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;!--/$--&gt;&#10;  &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  &lt;footer&gt;页脚&lt;/footer&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;!-- 后续块：延迟内容 --&gt;&#10;&lt;div hidden id=&quot;S:0&quot;&gt;&#10;  &lt;h1&gt;实际内容&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;  &lt;p&gt;这是从服务器获取的数据&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;script&gt;&#10;  // React 的内联脚本，将 S:0 的内容替换到 B:0 的位置&#10;  $RC(&#39;B:0&#39;, &#39;S:0&#39;);&#10;&lt;/script&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 第一块：Shell --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"root\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>网站标题&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">header</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!--$?--></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">template</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B:0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>加载中...&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    &#x3C;!--/$--></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>页脚&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">footer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">&#x3C;!-- 后续块：延迟内容 --></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> hidden</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S:0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>实际内容&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">h1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>这是从服务器获取的数据&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">div</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // React 的内联脚本，将 S:0 的内容替换到 B:0 的位置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  $RC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'B:0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'S:0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>&lt;!--$?--&gt;</code> 和 <code>&lt;!--/$--&gt;</code> 是 React 的 Suspense 边界标记。<code>$RC</code> 是 React 注入的客户端脚本函数，负责用实际内容替换 fallback。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"progressive-loading-渐进式加载\">Progressive Loading 渐进式加载</h2><p>通过嵌套 Suspense 可以实现精细的渐进式加载策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"async function ArticlePage({ slug }: { slug: string }) {&#10;  const article = await fetchArticle(slug);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;article&gt;&#10;      &lt;h1&gt;{article.title}&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;      &lt;p className=&quot;meta&quot;&gt;&#10;        {article.author} · {article.date}&#10;      &lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;{article.content}&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;RelatedSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;RelatedArticles category={article.category} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;CommentsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Comments articleId={article.id} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ReplyFormSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;ReplyForm articleId={article.id} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/article&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function ArticlePage({ slug }: { slug: string }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const article = await fetchArticle(slug);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h1>{article.title}&#x3C;/h1></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p className=\"meta\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {article.author} · {article.date}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div>{article.content}&#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;RelatedSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;RelatedArticles category={article.category} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;CommentsSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Comments articleId={article.id} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ReplyFormSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;ReplyForm articleId={article.id} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/article></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Shell: 文章标题 + 内容&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;第一波: RelatedArticles&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;第一波: Comments&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;第二波: ReplyForm&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A -.-&gt;|立即发送| E[用户开始阅读]&#10;    B -.-&gt;|~200ms 后| F[相关文章出现]&#10;    C -.-&gt;|~300ms 后| G[评论列表出现]&#10;    D -.-&gt;|~500ms 后| H[回复表单出现]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Shell: 文章标题 + 内容\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"第一波: RelatedArticles\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"第一波: Comments\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"第二波: ReplyForm\"]\n\n    A -.-&gt;|立即发送| E[用户开始阅读]\n    B -.-&gt;|~200ms 后| F[相关文章出现]\n    C -.-&gt;|~300ms 后| G[评论列表出现]\n    D -.-&gt;|~500ms 后| H[回复表单出现]</pre><h3 id=\"优先级控制\">优先级控制</h3><p>结合流式渲染和数据获取策略，可以控制内容的加载优先级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"async function Dashboard() {&#10;  const criticalDataPromise = fetchCriticalData();&#10;  const secondaryDataPromise = fetchSecondaryData();&#10;  const tertiaryDataPromise = fetchTertiaryData();&#10;&#10;  const criticalData = await criticalDataPromise;&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;CriticalSection data={criticalData} /&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;SecondaryLoader /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;SecondarySection dataPromise={secondaryDataPromise} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;TertiaryLoader /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;TertiarySection dataPromise={tertiaryDataPromise} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function SecondarySection({ dataPromise }: { dataPromise: Promise&lt;SecondaryData&gt; }) {&#10;  const data = await dataPromise;&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;{data.content}&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function Dashboard() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const criticalDataPromise = fetchCriticalData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const secondaryDataPromise = fetchSecondaryData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const tertiaryDataPromise = fetchTertiaryData();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const criticalData = await criticalDataPromise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;CriticalSection data={criticalData} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;SecondaryLoader />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;SecondarySection dataPromise={secondaryDataPromise} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;TertiaryLoader />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;TertiarySection dataPromise={tertiaryDataPromise} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function SecondarySection({ dataPromise }: { dataPromise: Promise&#x3C;SecondaryData> }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const data = await dataPromise;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>{data.content}&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"流式-ssr-与-seo\">流式 SSR 与 SEO</h2><p>流式 SSR 对 SEO 友好，因为搜索引擎爬虫会等待完整的 HTML 流传输完毕：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>搜索引擎</th>\n<th>流式支持</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Googlebot</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>会等待流结束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bingbot</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>支持流式 HTML</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社交媒体爬虫</td>\n<td>部分支持</td>\n<td>通常只读取初始 HTML</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>为确保社交媒体分享正常，关键元数据应放在 Shell 中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx&#10;export async function generateMetadata({ params }: { params: { slug: string } }): Promise&lt;Metadata&gt; {&#10;  const article = await fetchArticle(params.slug);&#10;  return {&#10;    title: article.title,&#10;    description: article.excerpt,&#10;    openGraph: {&#10;      title: article.title,&#10;      description: article.excerpt,&#10;      images: [article.coverImage],&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// app/blog/[slug]/page.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export async function generateMetadata({ params }: { params: { slug: string } }): Promise&#x3C;Metadata> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const article = await fetchArticle(params.slug);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title: article.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    description: article.excerpt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    openGraph: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      title: article.title,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      description: article.excerpt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      images: [article.coverImage],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"错误处理\">错误处理</h2><p>Suspense 边界内的错误会被最近的 Error Boundary 捕获。在流式 SSR 中，如果错误发生在 Suspense 内部，只有该区域会显示错误，其他区域正常：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;p&gt;内容加载失败&lt;/p&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;ContentSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;MainContent /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;      &lt;ErrorBoundary fallback={&lt;p&gt;评论加载失败&lt;/p&gt;}&gt;&#10;        &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;CommentsSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;          &lt;Comments /&gt;&#10;        &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;      &lt;/ErrorBoundary&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;p>内容加载失败&#x3C;/p>}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;ContentSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;MainContent /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ErrorBoundary fallback={&#x3C;p>评论加载失败&#x3C;/p>}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;CommentsSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Comments /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ErrorBoundary></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[App] --&gt; B[Header ✅]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;ErrorBoundary #1&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;ErrorBoundary #2&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;Suspense → MainContent ✅&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;Suspense → Comments ❌&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;显示: 评论加载失败&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;正常显示内容&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[App] --&gt; B[Header ✅]\n    A --&gt; C[\"ErrorBoundary #1\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"ErrorBoundary #2\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"Suspense → MainContent ✅\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"Suspense → Comments ❌\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"显示: 评论加载失败\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"正常显示内容\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>流式 SSR</strong> 突破传统 SSR 的&quot;全有或全无&quot;瓶颈，Shell 就绪即可发送响应</li>\n<li><strong>Suspense</strong> 定义流式边界，服务端先发送 fallback，延迟内容就绪后通过内联脚本替换</li>\n<li><strong>渐进式加载</strong> 通过嵌套 Suspense 实现内容的分层加载，关键内容优先展示</li>\n<li>流式 HTML 使用 chunked transfer encoding，浏览器可以边接收边解析渲染</li>\n<li>错误处理通过 ErrorBoundary + Suspense 组合实现局部降级，不影响其他区域</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"流式渲染与 Suspense","id":"流式渲染与-suspense"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"传统 SSR 的瓶颈","id":"传统-ssr-的瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"Suspense Boundaries","id":"suspense-boundaries"},{"level":2,"text":"Streaming HTML","id":"streaming-html"},{"level":2,"text":"Progressive Loading 渐进式加载","id":"progressive-loading-渐进式加载"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级控制","id":"优先级控制"},{"level":2,"text":"流式 SSR 与 SEO","id":"流式-ssr-与-seo"},{"level":2,"text":"错误处理","id":"错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Next.js App Router 应用路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/server-rendering/nextjs-app-router"},"next":{"title":"memo 与 useCallback","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/memo-and-callback"}}